"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"Nepal's disaster management service reports that the number of missing people has increased from 572 to 1,924. This includes many foreign nationals.\",            \"english_title\": \"Missing People in Nepal\",            \"translated_version\": \"El servicio de manejo de desastres de Nepal dice que el n\u00famero de personas desaparecidas ha subido de 572 a 1,924. Esto incluye a muchas personas de otros pa\u00edses.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Personas Desaparecidas en Nepal\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Mourners gather outside the palace to remember a beloved king. Royals, politicians, and citizens pay tribute. The king's son has adopted the family motto 'all for Norway'.\",            \"english_title\": \"Tribute to the King\",            \"translated_version\": \"Personas se re\u00fanen fuera del palacio para recordar a un rey querido. Reales, pol\u00edticos y ciudadanos rinden homenaje. El hijo del rey ha adoptado el lema familiar `todo por Noruega`.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Homenaje al Rey\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Police are searching for two suspects who they believe bought a ticket to an exhibition to steal jewelry.\",            \"english_title\": \"Jewelry Theft Suspects\",            \"translated_version\": \"La polic\u00eda busca a dos sospechosos que creen compraron un boleto para una exhibici\u00f3n para robar joyas.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Sospechosos de Robo de Joyas\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Experts looked into the use of forced contraception on the Inuit community during the 1960s and 70s.\",            \"english_title\": \"Inuit Contraception Investigation\",            \"translated_version\": \"Expertos investigaron el uso de anticoncepci\u00f3n forzada en la comunidad Inuit durante los a\u00f1os 1960 y 70.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Investigaci\u00f3n de Anticoncepci\u00f3n Inuit\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The military authorities took back control of a city 18 months ago, but fighting continues in other areas.\",            \"english_title\": \"City Control by Military\",            \"translated_version\": \"Las autoridades militares retomaron el control de una ciudad hace 18 meses, pero la lucha contin\u00faa en otras \u00e1reas.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Control de Ciudad por Militares\"        }    ]}"